Package: tailtevaluations
Title: Tailte Eireann Commercial Valuations: Refresh Pipeline and Shiny
    App
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "msand91@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pulls every rating authority from the Tailte Eireann
    Valuation API, validates the result and publishes Parquet, GeoJSON and
    a manifest to S3-compatible object storage on a schedule, using a
    'targets' pipeline. Includes a 'shiny' app for filtering properties,
    finding the nearest neighbours of any property and explaining how its
    valuation compares.
